# =============================================================================
# Saiful IPTV Player - Build-time configuration
# =============================================================================
# This is a reference only; the app does not load .env files.
# Provide client-safe values with `--dart-define=NAME=value`.
# Do not put service-role keys, passwords, or other secrets in a client build.
# =============================================================================

# Example:
# flutter run --dart-define=APP_ENV=development \
#   --dart-define=SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co \
#   --dart-define=SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-public-anon-key

# Supported defines: APP_ENV, SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY,
# API_BASE_URL, API_TIMEOUT_MS, ENABLE_ANALYTICS.
# APP_ENV is development or production.

